  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Shalom Ab Salom**: rare: 3 archived performances [6]\n- **Freedom**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Ween1993-05-07** (recommended): soundboard; 22 songs; 85 min; rated 5/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Listener finds the soundboard recording's sound quality good; Listener calls the soundboard an excellent recording given that it dates from the early 1990s [3][5]\n- **ween1993-05-07.sbd.shn**: soundboard; 22 songs; 85 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Uploader's track list slots Bumblebee between Papa Zit and Tick, but flags it with a question mark as possibly absent [1]\n- Boognish.com lists Bumblebee between Papa Zit and Tick, yet the uploader hears no gap suggesting missing music [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Ween1993-05-07**: source: SBD>? [1]\n- **ween1993-05-07.sbd.shn**: taped by Kirk Miller; transferred by Unknown; source: SBD [2]. Also: Uploader believes the soundboard shn file came from jkeats's FTP site years earlier [2]",
